[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 8.2,
    "text": "大家好"
  },
  {
    "start": 8.2,
    "end": 10.6,
    "text": "歡迎大家收看今次的"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.6,
    "end": 12.0,
    "text": "This is my architecture"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.0,
    "end": 13.200000000000001,
    "text": "我是Anson"
  },
  {
    "start": 13.200000000000001,
    "end": 15.4,
    "text": "AWS的Solutions Architect"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.4,
    "end": 17.6,
    "text": "今天我們有請到"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.6,
    "end": 19.8,
    "text": "Shopline的Engineering Director"
  },
  {
    "start": 19.8,
    "end": 20.6,
    "text": "Ronald"
  },
  {
    "start": 20.6,
    "end": 21.8,
    "text": "Ronald, welcome"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.8,
    "end": 24.8,
    "text": "可否跟大家分享一下"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.8,
    "end": 26.6,
    "text": "Shopline是做甚麼的"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.6,
    "end": 30.200000000000003,
    "text": "Shopline是一個全球智慧型的商務平台"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.200000000000003,
    "end": 33.6,
    "text": "我們幫客戶將它的生意做到世界各地"
  },
  {
    "start": 33.6,
    "end": 36.2,
    "text": "現在小型的網店"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.2,
    "end": 37.6,
    "text": "實體店"
  },
  {
    "start": 37.6,
    "end": 41.2,
    "text": "中小企甚至跨過的企業都是我們的客戶"
  },
  {
    "start": 41.2,
    "end": 44.6,
    "text": "以我所知現在在市場上"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.6,
    "end": 47.2,
    "text": "這些e-commerce的平台都不少"
  },
  {
    "start": 47.2,
    "end": 48.6,
    "text": "可否跟大家分享一下"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.6,
    "end": 53.2,
    "text": "以你所知市場的趨勢是怎樣"
  },
  {
    "start": 53.2,
    "end": 56.800000000000004,
    "text": "現在我們看到越來越多的以前開網店的店家"
  },
  {
    "start": 56.800000000000004,
    "end": 58.800000000000004,
    "text": "都會去考慮開實體店"
  },
  {
    "start": 58.800000000000004,
    "end": 60.400000000000006,
    "text": "當開實體店的時候"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.400000000000006,
    "end": 63.400000000000006,
    "text": "他們必須要考慮就是用一個PoS System"
  },
  {
    "start": 63.400000000000006,
    "end": 66.4,
    "text": "在使用PoS的經驗上面"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.4,
    "end": 68.8,
    "text": "其實經常都會有幾個問題"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.8,
    "end": 71.4,
    "text": "第一就是你的庫存管理"
  },
  {
    "start": 71.4,
    "end": 74.4,
    "text": "你有否一個地方可以統一去管理網店"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.4,
    "end": 76.0,
    "text": "和實體店上面的庫存"
  },
  {
    "start": 76.0,
    "end": 79.4,
    "text": "第二就是你的使用者是否可以同步"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.4,
    "end": 84.4,
    "text": "網店上面的使用者是否可以去到實體店上面"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.4,
    "end": 86.4,
    "text": "用回他網店上面的身份"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.4,
    "end": 89.4,
    "text": "或者他以前的購物紀錄去取得優惠呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 89.4,
    "end": 94.4,
    "text": "最後就是你實體店和網店上面的優惠"
  },
  {
    "start": 94.4,
    "end": 97.4,
    "text": "折扣是否可以去統一"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.4,
    "end": 100.60000000000001,
    "text": "例如在網店上面買過東西"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.60000000000001,
    "end": 102.4,
    "text": "你可能有些QPot"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.4,
    "end": 105.4,
    "text": "你去到實體店你可否可以用得回呢"
  },
  {
    "start": 105.4,
    "end": 108.4,
    "text": "這些就是一些很常見的PoS System的問題"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.4,
    "end": 111.0,
    "text": "聽來是一個很常見的"
  },
  {
    "start": 111.0,
    "end": 114.4,
    "text": "Online to offline O2O的問題"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.4,
    "end": 118.4,
    "text": "沒錯 都是一個比較技術的挑戰"
  },
  {
    "start": 118.4,
    "end": 123.4,
    "text": "以我所知Shortline最近都收購了一間PoS公司"
  },
  {
    "start": 123.4,
    "end": 125.4,
    "text": "可否跟大家分享一下"
  },
  {
    "start": 125.4,
    "end": 129.4,
    "text": "你是怎樣把你存在的AWS上面的"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.4,
    "end": 133.4,
    "text": "platform和三個派的系統去做integration"
  },
  {
    "start": 133.4,
    "end": 136.4,
    "text": "首先大家看看這個Diagram上面"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.4,
    "end": 138.4,
    "text": "其實就是現在Shortline"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.4,
    "end": 140.4,
    "text": "Ecommerce platform的infrastructure"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.4,
    "end": 143.4,
    "text": "你可以看到我們有一個MongoDB"
  },
  {
    "start": 143.4,
    "end": 145.4,
    "text": "我們有很多的ECS cluster"
  },
  {
    "start": 145.4,
    "end": 147.4,
    "text": "也有一個SSO的Gateway"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.4,
    "end": 150.4,
    "text": "和一個Buildon API Gateway的Open API"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.4,
    "end": 154.4,
    "text": "那麼第三個派的PoS其實就是在下面"
  },
  {
    "start": 154.4,
    "end": 156.4,
    "text": "它有一個CouchBate database"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.4,
    "end": 159.4,
    "text": "有一個PoS Client"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.4,
    "end": 160.4,
    "text": "就是一個Mobile App"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.4,
    "end": 162.4,
    "text": "也有一個PoS Admin的Reapplication"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.4,
    "end": 165.4,
    "text": "第一件事我們要做的首先就是"
  },
  {
    "start": 165.4,
    "end": 167.4,
    "text": "Authentication的integration"
  },
  {
    "start": 167.4,
    "end": 172.4,
    "text": "我們做了的就是把我們現在的Open API"
  },
  {
    "start": 172.4,
    "end": 177.4,
    "text": "令到它可以跟我們的SSO Gateway做Authentication"
  },
  {
    "start": 179.4,
    "end": 184.4,
    "text": "然後給我們的PoS Admin去call它的API"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.4,
    "end": 189.4,
    "text": "第二件事就是把PoS Client上面的Sync Gateway"
  },
  {
    "start": 189.4,
    "end": 190.4,
    "text": "的Client"
  },
  {
    "start": 190.4,
    "end": 192.4,
    "text": "就透過我們SSO Gateway"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.4,
    "end": 196.4,
    "text": "以OpenID的Voletical去做Authentication"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.4,
    "end": 198.4,
    "text": "當做完這兩件事的時候"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.4,
    "end": 201.4,
    "text": "其實現在的Shortline Merchant"
  },
  {
    "start": 201.4,
    "end": 204.4,
    "text": "就已經可以在PoS System上面"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.4,
    "end": 205.4,
    "text": "作為一個User的操作"
  },
  {
    "start": 205.4,
    "end": 207.4,
    "text": "非常好"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.4,
    "end": 211.4,
    "text": "我看到這裡你選用了AWS的API Gateway Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 211.4,
    "end": 214.4,
    "text": "可以建立一個Open API"
  },
  {
    "start": 214.4,
    "end": 218.4,
    "text": "可否解釋一下你當初為何選用這個Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 218.4,
    "end": 220.4,
    "text": "最大的考量是在於"
  },
  {
    "start": 220.4,
    "end": 222.4,
    "text": "API Gateway其實是一個"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.4,
    "end": 224.4,
    "text": "全管理的Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 224.4,
    "end": 226.4,
    "text": "我們不需要幫它"
  },
  {
    "start": 226.4,
    "end": 228.4,
    "text": "考慮它的Low Balancer"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.4,
    "end": 230.4,
    "text": "不需要管理它背後的Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.4,
    "end": 233.4,
    "text": "第二件事就是它其實是很不延長的"
  },
  {
    "start": 233.4,
    "end": 234.4,
    "text": "像我們這個例子"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.4,
    "end": 237.4,
    "text": "其實本身的Open API是做一個"
  },
  {
    "start": 237.4,
    "end": 239.4,
    "text": "Token Based Authentication"
  },
  {
    "start": 239.4,
    "end": 241.4,
    "text": "因為它支援一些"
  },
  {
    "start": 241.4,
    "end": 243.4,
    "text": "Custom Authentication Method"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.4,
    "end": 245.4,
    "text": "我們也很簡單可以令它"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.4,
    "end": 247.4,
    "text": "可以跟SSO的OAuth"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.4,
    "end": 248.4,
    "text": "做一個Authentication"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.4,
    "end": 250.4,
    "text": "最後就是API Gateway"
  },
  {
    "start": 250.4,
    "end": 252.4,
    "text": "原生就會有一個WARF"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.4,
    "end": 253.4,
    "text": "和Shell的Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 253.4,
    "end": 254.4,
    "text": "也會提供一個"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.4,
    "end": 256.4,
    "text": "可靠的Security"
  },
  {
    "start": 256.4,
    "end": 257.4,
    "text": "的Protection"
  },
  {
    "start": 257.4,
    "end": 259.4,
    "text": "所以是一些AWS的Managed Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 259.4,
    "end": 262.4,
    "text": "可以幫到你又快又簡單"
  },
  {
    "start": 262.4,
    "end": 265.4,
    "text": "去建立一個安全可效的Open API"
  },
  {
    "start": 265.4,
    "end": 266.4,
    "text": "非常好"
  },
  {
    "start": 266.4,
    "end": 269.4,
    "text": "這裡是Front End"
  },
  {
    "start": 269.4,
    "end": 272.4,
    "text": "你剛才提到"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.4,
    "end": 273.4,
    "text": "我們Back End的Data"
  },
  {
    "start": 273.4,
    "end": 274.4,
    "text": "也有做Synchronization"
  },
  {
    "start": 274.4,
    "end": 276.4,
    "text": "可不可以跟大家說一下"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.4,
    "end": 277.4,
    "text": "如何安裝Synchronize"
  },
  {
    "start": 277.4,
    "end": 279.4,
    "text": "兩邊的Database"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.4,
    "end": 280.4,
    "text": "大家都看到"
  },
  {
    "start": 280.4,
    "end": 281.4,
    "text": "這兩個Database"
  },
  {
    "start": 281.4,
    "end": 283.4,
    "text": "其實是處於不同的Network"
  },
  {
    "start": 283.4,
    "end": 285.4,
    "text": "而我們的MongoDB"
  },
  {
    "start": 285.4,
    "end": 287.4,
    "text": "其實是一個Internal Subway"
  },
  {
    "start": 287.4,
    "end": 289.4,
    "text": "所以外界的Internet"
  },
  {
    "start": 289.4,
    "end": 290.4,
    "text": "其實是沒有辦法Asses到的"
  },
  {
    "start": 290.4,
    "end": 293.4,
    "text": "如果我們要做一個Data Synchronization"
  },
  {
    "start": 293.4,
    "end": 296.4,
    "text": "我們必須要首先"
  },
  {
    "start": 296.4,
    "end": 298.4,
    "text": "將Colchbase"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.4,
    "end": 300.4,
    "text": "加入一個Kafka的Streaming Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 300.4,
    "end": 302.4,
    "text": "去跟它做Communication"
  },
  {
    "start": 302.4,
    "end": 304.4,
    "text": "而在我們自己的Infrastructure"
  },
  {
    "start": 304.4,
    "end": 307.4,
    "text": "就要加入一個很小的ECS Cluster"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.4,
    "end": 309.4,
    "text": "我們叫它做ProsiWorker"
  },
  {
    "start": 309.4,
    "end": 311.4,
    "text": "去跟MongoDB做Communication"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.4,
    "end": 314.4,
    "text": "透過ProsiWorker"
  },
  {
    "start": 314.4,
    "end": 316.4,
    "text": "和Kafka"
  },
  {
    "start": 316.4,
    "end": 318.4,
    "text": "和Colchbase"
  },
  {
    "start": 318.4,
    "end": 321.4,
    "text": "去做一個Bidirectional的Data Synchronization"
  },
  {
    "start": 321.4,
    "end": 324.4,
    "text": "這樣看來"
  },
  {
    "start": 324.4,
    "end": 326.4,
    "text": "前面和後面加起來"
  },
  {
    "start": 326.4,
    "end": 327.4,
    "text": "有些改變都不少"
  },
  {
    "start": 327.4,
    "end": 329.4,
    "text": "在一個Production Environment"
  },
  {
    "start": 329.4,
    "end": 330.4,
    "text": "你明白"
  },
  {
    "start": 330.4,
    "end": 332.4,
    "text": "你究竟是如何處理這麼多改變"
  },
  {
    "start": 332.4,
    "end": 334.4,
    "text": "以及你真的花了多少時間去做"
  },
  {
    "start": 334.4,
    "end": 337.4,
    "text": "最後你為什麼想用我們ECS"
  },
  {
    "start": 337.4,
    "end": 340.4,
    "text": "作為一個主要的Colchbase"
  },
  {
    "start": 340.4,
    "end": 343.4,
    "text": "去做這麼多的Aligo Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 343.4,
    "end": 345.4,
    "text": "其實ECS是一個我們覺得很適合"
  },
  {
    "start": 345.4,
    "end": 348.4,
    "text": "用來做Micro Service Infrastructure的服務"
  },
  {
    "start": 348.4,
    "end": 349.4,
    "text": "在Shopline"
  },
  {
    "start": 349.4,
    "end": 351.4,
    "text": "其實我們大量應用了ECS"
  },
  {
    "start": 351.4,
    "end": 353.4,
    "text": "這個Cluster的服務"
  },
  {
    "start": 353.4,
    "end": 356.4,
    "text": "去幫我們做到很多不同的Micro Service"
  },
  {
    "start": 356.4,
    "end": 359.4,
    "text": "所以當你看到這個Data Synchronization"
  },
  {
    "start": 359.4,
    "end": 361.4,
    "text": "其實我們的Integration的Change"
  },
  {
    "start": 361.4,
    "end": 364.4,
    "text": "主要是集中在三個Component"
  },
  {
    "start": 364.4,
    "end": 366.4,
    "text": "就是一個新的ECS Cluster"
  },
  {
    "start": 366.4,
    "end": 368.4,
    "text": "我們存在的SSL Gateway"
  },
  {
    "start": 368.4,
    "end": 370.4,
    "text": "去加入OpenID"
  },
  {
    "start": 370.4,
    "end": 374.4,
    "text": "還有最後就是把我們的OpenAPI"
  },
  {
    "start": 374.4,
    "end": 377.4,
    "text": "伸展去支援SSL的Authentication"
  },
  {
    "start": 377.4,
    "end": 381.4,
    "text": "其他存在的Ecommerce Platform"
  },
  {
    "start": 381.4,
    "end": 384.4,
    "text": "基本上是不需要任何改動的"
  },
  {
    "start": 384.4,
    "end": 386.4,
    "text": "不論是網路應用"
  },
  {
    "start": 386.4,
    "end": 388.4,
    "text": "搜尋 engine"
  },
  {
    "start": 388.4,
    "end": 389.4,
    "text": "或者是我們的Cache"
  },
  {
    "start": 389.4,
    "end": 391.4,
    "text": "全部都是不需要任何改變的"
  },
  {
    "start": 391.4,
    "end": 394.4,
    "text": "這個我們都覺得是一個很大的優勢"
  },
  {
    "start": 394.4,
    "end": 397.4,
    "text": "令到我們可以在短短三個月之內"
  },
  {
    "start": 397.4,
    "end": 399.4,
    "text": "將整個Integration完成"
  },
  {
    "start": 399.4,
    "end": 400.4,
    "text": "和推出市場"
  },
  {
    "start": 400.4,
    "end": 401.4,
    "text": "非常好"
  },
  {
    "start": 401.4,
    "end": 403.4,
    "text": "很高興我們ECS幫助你"
  },
  {
    "start": 403.4,
    "end": 407.4,
    "text": "去建立一個Micro Service架構"
  },
  {
    "start": 407.4,
    "end": 410.4,
    "text": "將來你們的Road Map"
  },
  {
    "start": 410.4,
    "end": 411.4,
    "text": "會做些什麼呢?"
  },
  {
    "start": 411.4,
    "end": 412.4,
    "text": "我看到這裡有X3"
  },
  {
    "start": 412.4,
    "end": 413.4,
    "text": "有CloudWatch"
  },
  {
    "start": 413.4,
    "end": 415.4,
    "text": "可否跟大家分享一下?"
  },
  {
    "start": 415.4,
    "end": 417.4,
    "text": "因為整個Integration"
  },
  {
    "start": 417.4,
    "end": 421.4,
    "text": "將Paw System上的所有活動"
